# Text files keep LF line endings on every OS, so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the
# GitHub runners) matches Linux and macOS byte for byte. Tests parse docs line by line, and
# generated SVG artwork is compared byte for byte and copied byte for byte into the renderer.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert line endings or diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
